### foo
#### foo
##### foo
###### foo
```

**Expected HTML output:**

```html
<h1>foo</h1>
<h2>foo</h2>
<h3>foo</h3>
<h4>foo</h4>
<h5>foo</h5>
<h6>foo</h6>
